{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/nieuwe_kerk.json \u2014 RoomSpec for De Nieuwe Kerk (the city, district 4: the Dam): the Nieuwe Kerk inside, made an emergency shelter: rows of camp beds down the nave and the aisles under the gothic arcades and the wooden vault, the first aid post by the door, the great organ on its gallery at the far end; most of the beds empty, some not. Its front wall is the street's shopfront (\"facade\": the street builds it); its door is the street's. Every business name is made up. Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
